"entity": {
"name": "Scout24 SE",
"description": "Scout24 SE is a holding company, which engages in the provision and development of digital marketing solutions. The firm\u2019s brands include Immo Scout24, Flowfact, Vermietet.de, immoverkauf24, Propstack, BaufiTeam, Sprengnetter, Wohnungsboerse, bulwiengesa, exploreal, neubau kompass, and Energie Ausweis 48. It operates through the Professional and Private segments. The Professional segment refers to memberships and ImmoScout24 Austria product. The Private segment includes TenantPlus, BuyerPlus, LivingPlus, and LettingPlus products. The company was founded in 1998 and is headquartered in Munich, Germany.",
